"title":"云雾敛","video_desc":"打工人宋瑶枝猝死穿成虐文女主，一心和离保命。却误与暴君岑䘝生死相连，诗会崭露头角得罪白莲女配。在与岑䘝相处中感情升温，成功和离。最后岑䘝提亲，宋瑶枝答应，举行大婚成为皇后，改写命运。","series_id":"7464039506216242201","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623570305366B738D7DEDA32972\",\"rank\":\"2\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7464039506216242201\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7091062068939209,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.06482469290494919,\\\"like\\\":0.048136770725250244,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.026911735534668,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.10376515984535217,\\\"collect\\\":0.03676946833729744,\\\"finish\\\":0.0023231622762978077}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7464039506216242201","play_cnt":86808,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"溯光","sub_title":"爱情·古风爱情","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":72,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5051,\"name\":\"古风爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5051&categoryName=古风爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5170,\"name\":\"穿书\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5170&categoryName=穿书&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5104,\"name\":\"日久生情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5104&categoryName=日久生情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5178,\"name\":\"逆风翻盘\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5178&categoryName=逆风翻盘&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5109,\"name\":\"生死契约\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5109&categoryName=生死契约&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5339,\"name\":\"古代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5339&categoryName=古代&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"}]","color_dominate":"#281818","horiz_cover":"","sub_title_list":[{"content":"爱情","data_type":3},{"content":"2890万热度","data_type":27}],"pay_info":{},"support_listen":false,"recommend_reason_list":"{\"sub_title_list\":[{\"content\":\"爱情\",\"data_type\":3},{\"content\":\"2890万热度\",\"data_type\":27}]}"}],"category_tag_ids":null,"style":{"cover_size":0,"interval_type":0,"use_wide_item_space":false,"use_new_booklist_style":false,"with_favorite_button":false,"show_more_book_abstract":false,"candidate_postion":0,"jump_to_page":0,"topic_square_with_book":false,"use_aweme_sdk":false,"use_new_one_to_one_point_four_ratio_style":false,"hide_tab_selector":false,"audio_both_jump_player":false,"show_username":false,"use_selector_v2":false,"video_inner_next_item":0},"group_id_type":9,"cell_long_press_action":{"type":0},"cell_item_source_info":{"item_source":1},"ai_search_placeholder":null,"push_start_info":null,"book_hot_content_data":null},{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7472268289876446270","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/bf5d67ea3f43119f4820f8830ec2d181~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799164625&x-signature=7yXamBg7HXRzTTR1lFcxpkrbM6Q%3D","duration":3798,"title":"爱已无踪","video_desc":"能看见孩子胎心的那天，谢安然相恋十年的男朋友陆明非带着他的小情人撞掉了他们的孩子。深夜，看着男人扔来的求婚戒指上，写着小情人的名字，谢安然积攒了十年的爱意在那一刻彻底归零，她颤抖着手给自己的小叔叔打去了电话。谢安然：“小叔叔，我想回家了。”谢寰宇：“好。”她走后，陆明非看着被留下来的合照，蓦然红了眼。陆明非：“连我们唯一的合照都不愿意带走，谢安然，你真狠心。”","series_id":"7472231389358722110","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623570305366B738D7DEDA32972\",\"rank\":\"3\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7472231389358722110\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"collect\\\":0.02843603305518