esc":"程乔是公司里兢兢业业的社畜小会计，与冷面上司‘祁阎王’祁怀远共事三年，没说过三句话。直到弟弟程寻冲进公司，在众目睽睽之下抱着祁怀远叫姐夫，还说自己来自10年后，在未来，祁怀远就是他姐夫，暗恋了姐姐好多年，后腰还纹着她的名字！程乔当场社死，觉得自己饭碗不保了，殊不知，另一边，祁阎王找到了程寻，冷声问道：“我的纹身，你是怎么知道的？”","series_id":"7639587190120401944","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623570305366B738D7DEDA32972\",\"rank\":\"9\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7639587190120401944\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"collect\\\":0.0446808747947216,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.05077509209513664,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.3283401727676392,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7622472047805786,\\\"like\\\":0.05921025201678276,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.14183014631271362,\\\"finish\\\":0.0023231622762978077}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7639587190120401944","play_cnt":4507571,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"浙江东阳小团圆文化传媒有限公司","sub_title":"爱情·都市爱情","score":"8.0","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":76,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5061,\"name\":\"都市爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5061&categoryName=都市爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5104,\"name\":\"日久生情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5104&categoryName=日久生情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5123,\"name\":\"穿越\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5123&categoryName=穿越&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5206,\"name\":\"总裁\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5206&categoryName=总裁&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5275,\"name\":\"宠妻\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5275&categoryName=宠妻&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5